@startuml US009_SD_1
title Changing a logged quantity
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant Frontend as UI
participant ":JWT Authentication Filter" as Auth
participant ":DailyLogController" as Ctrl
participant ":DailyLogApplicationService" as Svc
participant ":DailyLogRepository" as Repo
participant ":DailyLog" as Log
participant ":Meal" as Meal
participant ":MealItemFactory" as Factory
participant ":MealItem" as Item
participant ":NutrientScalingService" as Scaling
participant ":DailyLogMapper" as Mapper


User -> UI : selects a logged item and enters a new positive quantity
UI -> Auth : PATCH /api/daily-log/today/items/{itemId}/quantity\n{quantity} + bearer token
Auth -> Ctrl : authenticated userId, itemId, request DTO
Ctrl -> Svc : changeItemQuantity(userId, itemId, request)

Svc -> Repo : findByUserIdAndDate(userId, today)
Repo --> Svc : today's owned DailyLog with meals and items
Svc -> Log : getItem(itemId)
Log -> Log : locate the selected item within this aggregate
Log --> Svc : MealItem
Svc -> Factory: changeItemQuantity(mealItemId,newAmount)
Factory -> Item: read existing unit and portion
create participant ":PortionQuantity" as Portion
Factory -> Portion : new PortionQuantity(newAmount, existing unit/metadata)
Portion --> Item : validated immutable replacement
Factory -> Item : replace portionQuantity reference
Item --> Factory : quantity updated; FoodSnapshot retained
Factory --> Log : quantity updated
Log --> Svc : item updated
Svc -> Log : calculateNutritionSummary(scalingService)
Log -> Meal : calculateNutrientTotals(scalingService)
Meal -> Scaling : calculateContribution(snapshot, portion) for each item
Scaling --> Meal : item nutrient contributions
Meal --> Log : meal totals
Log --> Svc : DailyNutritionSummary from intake and stored goals
Svc -> Repo : save(log)
Repo --> Svc : saved DailyLog
Svc -> Mapper : toResponseDTO(savedLog, summary)
Mapper --> Svc : DailyLogResponseDTO with item identities and meal totals
Svc --> Ctrl : DailyLogResponseDTO
Ctrl --> UI : 200 OK + DailyLogResponseDTO
UI --> User : displays updated meals and daily nutrition

@enduml
